      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In addition to a more comprehensive optimization benchmark system, I think this wouldn't be too bad. But it should be disabled by default, it should be a setting, and we get to choose which optimization level we want to show and hide.\n\nThen add something on the HUD that shows if people have your avatar hidden because it's too ill-performant.\n\nBut we shouldn't frown upon giving users more control over their experience. Having this setting as an opt-in rather than an opt-out leaves it up to the individual users to penalize avatar makers, rather then systematically penalizing them. Democracy.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5c3cc78977470b40916d5268",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5bab4096e98ddc66e3477da5",
        "alias": "Bisque Kite",
        "aliasID": "65c577aeed6eefce4cc5c02b",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/4b5c989fab0ee6dde0290c7246d53736.jpg",
        "created": "2018-09-26T08:17:26.079Z",
        "name": "Little Mouse",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": "<redacted>"
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62efae9868f3662e9d9a1",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2019-01-14T17:31:53.831Z",
      "deleted": false,
