      "value": "@{5bcb7c5866dca960a139090c|full_name}: I mean I get where are you getting at, but the game first needs some baseline optimization before going that way, and also there are like thousands of Avatar Worlds with unoptimized Avatars, usually people wander around them grabbing that thing and go into the next world to meet people, so we would take a two sided edge, since new players also get affected by that, why you ask? Because they don't know better and just like that particually poor or very poor avatar. So it would not only affect the players that have unoptimized shit on purpose but also new players.",
