      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I disagree completely with this. I go to many shows in VR where the performers will wear unoptimized avatars. People shouldn't be forced not to see them, like someone else said they already have an option in place that allows us to hide avatars. Also, not all of us lag because of it. Before entering a busy instance, just fix your settings to ensure they're hidden before you enter.",
